[FILE:353:descriptions/desc.primary]
Alacritty is a modern terminal emulator that comes with sensible defaults, 
but allows for extensive configuration. By integrating with other 
applications, rather than reimplementing their functionality, it manages 
to provide a flexible set of features with high performance. It uses GPU 
acceleration (OpenGL) to outperform other terminal emulators.


[FILE:67:descriptions/desc.completions]
This subpackage contains the completions for:

- Bash
- Fish
- ZSH


